          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2603.11078",
          "summary": "CR-Bench is a benchmarking dataset paired with CR-Evaluator, a fine-grained pipeline for code review agents, addressing coarse success metrics and costly false positives. A preliminary study of single-shot and Reflexion-based agents finds a low signal-to-noise ratio and a trade-off between issue resolution and spurious findings.",
