          "title": "Semantic Chameleon: Corpus-Dependent Poisoning Attacks and Defenses in RAG Systems",
          "title_zh": "语义变色龙：RAG 系统中依赖语料的投毒攻击与防御",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2603.18034v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2603.18034",
          "summary": "The paper studies gradient-guided corpus poisoning attacks on RAG pipelines using paired sleeper and trigger documents optimized with GCG. On a 67,941-document corpus the attacks reached a 38.0% co-retrieval rate under vector-only retrieval, while hybrid BM25-plus-vector retrieval reduced attack success from 38% to 0% in the reported tests, though jointly optimized payloads could still reach 20-44%.",
